{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26214","headline":"早朝 · 殷尧藩","name":"早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曙锺催入紫宸朝，列炬流虹映绦绡。\n天近鳌头花簇杖，风低豹尾乐鸣韶。\n衣冠一变无夷俗，律令重颁有正条。\n昨日锺山甘露降，玻璃满赐出宫瓢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26214.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26214","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}